Inspect the factory schema

Usage:
  schema-template-variants schema [flags]
  schema-template-variants schema [command]

Available Commands:
  show        Print the factory's input declarations
  template    Print a starter stack file for this factory

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for schema

Global Flags:
      --asset-cache-dir string   Directory for materialized factory assets.

Use "schema-template-variants schema [command] --help" for more information about a command.
